### Get regular CSRF token
# @name regularCsrf
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/csrf

### Regular login
# @prompt regularUsername Regular username or email (case-insensitive)
# @prompt regularPassword Regular password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-TGP-USER-XSRF-TOKEN: {{regularCsrf.response.body.$.token}}

username={{regularUsername}}&password={{regularPassword}}

### Current regular session identity
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me

### Regular logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
X-TGP-USER-XSRF-TOKEN: {{regularCsrf.response.body.$.token}}

### Get admin CSRF token
# @name adminCsrf
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth/csrf

### Admin or moderator login
# @prompt adminUsername Admin or moderator username or email (case-insensitive)
# @prompt adminPassword Admin or moderator password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-TGP-ADMIN-XSRF-TOKEN: {{adminCsrf.response.body.$.token}}

username={{adminUsername}}&password={{adminPassword}}

### Current admin session identity
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth/me

### Admin authorization denied example
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth/me
Cookie: TGP_USER_SESSION=regular-session-placeholder

### Admin logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth/logout
X-TGP-ADMIN-XSRF-TOKEN: {{adminCsrf.response.body.$.token}}

### Coexistence: regular identity still uses the regular cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me

### Coexistence: admin identity still uses the admin cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth/me

### Regular API with user session cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users

### Regular API with bearer token remains supported
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Regular API credential conflict example
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer jwt-for-a-different-user
Cookie: TGP_USER_SESSION=user-session-placeholder
